{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201320","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1820132001:1":{"text":"呜呜，诺珐斯的旅店商人好黑……","source_cn":"呜呜，诺珐斯的旅店商人好黑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D16142B8B5C73CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820132002:1":{"text":"怎么，他敢欺负你吗？等着，姨妈现在就去把他的胳膊掰下来——","source_cn":"怎么，他敢欺负你吗？等着，姨妈现在就去把他的胳膊掰下来——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB408D7B3327606AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820132003:1":{"text":"——不不不，他没有欺负我！他给所有人的汇率都是一样的。","source_cn":"——不不不，他没有欺负我！他给所有人的汇率都是一样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E766560F2AE804","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820132004:1":{"text":"但他给出的汇率实在高得吓人！有人想讲讲价，那个商人还大言不惭地表示自己是良心价，隔壁酒馆才是真的黑心。","source_cn":"但他给出的汇率实在高得吓人！有人想讲讲价，那个商人还大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA763AC8CCB8A8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820132005:1":{"text":"有人不服，当场就打算去月弯街尽头的那个酒馆问问价。","source_cn":"有人不服，当场就打算去月弯街尽头的那个酒馆问问价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C97BEB63B41518B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f